WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Ben automated his entire job.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.720
By Monday,

00:00:02.775 --> 00:00:04.700
he was working twelve minutes a day.

00:00:04.768 --> 00:00:05.680
By Friday,

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.760
his boss wanted to know his secret.

00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:09.040
That was the problem.

00:00:09.098 --> 00:00:10.360
Three weeks earlier,

00:00:10.413 --> 00:00:13.620
Ben's job had been moving information between rectangles.

00:00:13.684 --> 00:00:15.650
An email became a spreadsheet.

00:00:15.711 --> 00:00:17.610
The spreadsheet became a report.

00:00:17.671 --> 00:00:20.925
The report became a presentation explaining the spreadsheet.
